    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "integrity doesnt pay the bills or bring back my friends. all i have is this empty apartment and the feeling that the world is just this corrupt machine that crushes anyone who tries to do something good. it feels like i've been punished for being a human being. honestly, i'm just exhausted. i'm so tired of fighting a losing battle. what's the use in trying to rebuild when the foundation was never even real?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
