      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is completely understandable to feel exhausted and profoundly cynical after such a brutal experience. Feeling like the system itself is rigged against honest people is a deeply disheartening reality. Instead of focusing on rebuilding the old foundation, perhaps the next focus can be on building something entirely new for yourself, something independent of that former environment. Taking small, manageable steps toward personal stability, even when the whole picture feels hopeless, can offer a small anchor during this storm.",
      "source": "target",
